It's time for unforgettable adventures. For example, in the game Breached, you'll travel to a future that turns out to be quite suspicious. There are no people, no living creatures, only a vast desert with mysterious artifacts of unknown origin. But there's no time to ponder; you urgently need to find materials to repair the time machine and return to your own time, telling the story of humanity's bleak future.

An interesting aspect is the gameplay itself, which is synchronized with multiple screens that must be switched between, while simultaneously achieving success in your research.

Game elements:
- the controls are presented in the format of a kind of skill tree, each available screen has its own range of actions that allow you to perform certain tasks;
- there is a map filled with various sectors of completely different nature, you need to explore them and find all the necessary elements for your ship;
- split screen is specific to each sector, meaning you can be in several places at the same time;
- you will be in the control room, where all the necessary information on your research is available, as well as on the condition of the machine that requires repair;
- you will have a personal workshop where all the resources you find will be stored, and you will be able to synthesize them, create specific items, and even explore mysterious artifacts;
- the horizon is a specific area of the game that allows you to enjoy the landscape and even read the pilot's thoughts.
Breached promises to be an engaging and captivating adventure that primarily challenges your perception, reflection, and skills. Will you be able to survive in this dangerous environment? Then download Breached via torrent for free and prove it for yourself.

